d=List(items=["**OneNote**: best if you want the most polished free Android + web sync experience, but its free storage cap is the main constraint.","**Simplenote**: best for plain text notes and lightweight syncing across Android and web.","**Joplin**: best for offline use and exportable, user-owned notes, with sync flexibility rather than a large free cloud quota."])
